    "Opening is real live typing, not Creep.",
    "Growth and material clocks may be accelerated in the film; no native algorithm or threshold changes.",
    "Looks preserve plant seeds and geometry; fonts genuinely refit to scanned glyphs.",
    "Materials use separate clean native simulations of the same rose-to-glyph encounter.",
    "No continuous sequence or full-resolution final render is produced in this pass."
  ]
